                    "text": "shapeID"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " values identify a geometry within one build and are not stable across releases. The geometry is generalized and shoreline-clipped, sourced from the U.S. Census Bureau — the same provenance cluster as this pack's Census Gazetteer and TIGER records, not independent corroboration. This page presents geoBoundaries' own published values; it is not the place to compare geoBoundaries against other sources — that comparison lives on "
